<title>USA: Canadian Cty ISD 27, Okla. won by EVEREN.</title>
<headline>Canadian Cty ISD 27, Okla. won by EVEREN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities said it won $1.05 million of Canadian Cty Ind Sch Dist No 27, Okla., general obligation building of 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.54 percent.</p>
